      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Dunstan is an electoral district of the House of Assembly in the Australian state of South Australia, covering the inner eastern suburbs of Beulah Park, College Park, Evandale, Firle, Hackney, Joslin, Kensington, Kent Town, Marden, Maylands, Norwood, Payneham South, Royston Park, St Morris, St Peters, Stepney, Trinity Gardens and Vale Park and parts of Klemzig and Payneham.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9999999950991812,
